{"2605530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FPVSIM Drone Simulator", "steam_appid": 2605530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Real FPV feel, freestyle, and racing</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic quadrotor dynamics with motor, propeller, throttle, PID, and rate behavior tuned for FPV stick response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betaflight-style rates, Actual rates, throttle curves, level/angle mode, and transmitter-friendly calibration tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freestyle and racing maps, gate practice, lap timing, leaderboards, DVR replay, and a toggleable stick overlay for learning tricks and reviewing runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for radio controllers, DJI-style controllers, and gamepads, with best results from a real transmitter.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPVSIM is a high-fidelity FPV drone simulator built for pilots who care about realistic stick feel, responsive controls, and credible quad behavior. Practice freestyle, race gates, cinematic lines, city dives, gaps, and beginner training without risking real hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for FPV feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quadrotor simulation with motor, propeller, throttle, PID, and rate behavior tuned for believable stick response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Betaflight-style rates, Actual rates, throttle curves, level/angle mode, and tuning controls for pilots who want their sim quad to match their habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Support for common radio controllers, drone transmitters, and gamepads, with calibration tools for axis assignment, inversion, offsets, scale, and full stick travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freestyle, race, and improve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Practice racing lines with gates, lap timing, leaderboards, and custom track tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use DVR/replay and the toggleable stick overlay to study tricks, throttle control, race lines, and crashes after each flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore real-world-style locations through Google Maps integration, or train in purpose-built FPV scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For new and experienced pilots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with level mode and approachable controller settings, then move into acro, higher rates, tighter gates, power loops, dives, and serious race practice. FPVSIM is designed to help new pilots build confidence and experienced pilots keep real-world stick skills sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the best experience, use an OpenTX/EdgeTX radio, a DJI-style controller with joystick/gamepad support, or another transmitter that exposes joystick axes to Windows. Standard gamepads are supported too, but a real radio will feel closer to flying an actual FPV quad.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPVSIM is a high-fidelity FPV drone simulator built for pilots who care about realistic stick feel, responsive controls, and credible quad behavior. Practice freestyle, race gates, cinematic lines, city dives, gaps, and beginner training without risking real hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for FPV feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quadrotor simulation with motor, propeller, throttle, PID, and rate behavior tuned for believable stick response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Betaflight-style rates, Actual rates, throttle curves, level/angle mode, and tuning controls for pilots who want their sim quad to match their habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Support for common radio controllers, drone transmitters, and gamepads, with calibration tools for axis assignment, inversion, offsets, scale, and full stick travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freestyle, race, and improve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Practice racing lines with gates, lap timing, leaderboards, and custom track tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use DVR/replay and the toggleable stick overlay to study tricks, throttle control, race lines, and crashes after each flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore real-world-style locations through Google Maps integration, or train in purpose-built FPV scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For new and experienced pilots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with level mode and approachable controller settings, then move into acro, higher rates, tighter gates, power loops, dives, and serious race practice. FPVSIM is designed to help new pilots build confidence and experienced pilots keep real-world stick skills sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the best experience, use an OpenTX/EdgeTX radio, a DJI-style controller with joystick/gamepad support, or another transmitter that exposes joystick axes to Windows. Standard gamepads are supported too, but a real radio will feel closer to flying an actual FPV quad.</p>", "short_description": "A high-fidelity FPV freestyle and racing simulator built for realistic stick feel, low-latency transmitter control, Betaflight-style tuning, beautiful environments, lap timing, leaderboards, and DVR replay.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605530/header.jpg?t=1779670468", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605530/a581edec7e9ab6e795e2242e544eafe15bbbf91d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779670468", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605530/a581edec7e9ab6e795e2242e544eafe15bbbf91d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779670468", "website": "https://fpvsim.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "ext_user_account_notice": "https://fpvsim.com ", "developers": ["fpvsim.com"], "publishers": ["fpvsim.com"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$8.99"}, "packages": [934947], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy FPVSIM Drone Simulator", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 934947, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "FPVSIM Drone Simulator - $8.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 899}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "9", "description": "Racing"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "18", "description": "Sports"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605530/ss_035f7659989e13e604b01b3de8f535efa509abe8.600x338.jpg?t=1779670468", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605530/ss_035f7659989e13e604b01b3de8f535efa509abe8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779670468"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https